    <string name="setup_welcome_title">Welcome to SV Launcher</string>
    <string name="setup_welcome_text">A light home screen for your TV: favorites, all your apps and changing wallpapers.\n\nSetup takes about a minute. Any step can be skipped with “Next”, and everything can be changed later in the launcher settings.</string>
    <string name="setup_default_title">Make it the default launcher</string>
    <string name="setup_default_text">First choose SV Launcher in the system list of home screens. If the Home button still opens the stock screen after that (this happens on Google TV), also turn on the SV Launcher service in the accessibility settings.\n\nThe service only reacts to the Home button. It does not read the screen and collects no data.</string>
    <string name="setup_wallpaper_title">Wallpapers</string>
    <string name="setup_wallpaper_text">Choose where the background images come from. Only the cloud collection uses the internet; a theme for it can be picked later in the settings.</string>
    <string name="setup_wallpaper_builtin">Built-in wallpapers</string>
    <string name="setup_wallpaper_builtin_summary">Images that come with the app. Nothing is downloaded</string>
    <string name="setup_wallpaper_cloud">Cloud collection</string>
    <string name="setup_wallpaper_cloud_summary">Themed collections from the internet, updated over time</string>
    <string name="setup_wallpaper_own">My own images</string>
    <string name="setup_wallpaper_own_summary">Add them later in the settings. Nothing is downloaded</string>
    <string name="setup_wallpaper_off">No wallpaper</string>
    <string name="setup_wallpaper_off_summary">A plain dark background. Nothing is downloaded</string>
    <string name="setup_stats_title">System indicators</string>
    <string name="setup_stats_text">A status line under the date. Press an item to turn it on or off.</string>
    <string name="setup_shown">Shown</string>
    <string name="setup_not_shown">Not shown</string>
    <string name="setup_done_title">Everything is ready</string>
    <string name="setup_done_text">Hold OK on an app to open its menu: pin it to favorites, move it or hide it.\n\nFavorites live on their own panel above the list and scroll sideways.\n\nThe gear in the top right corner opens the launcher settings.</string>

