    <string name="service_manual">This TV does not let apps open its accessibility settings directly. Turn the service on by hand:\n\n1. Press “Open settings”.\n2. Go to Device Preferences → Accessibility.\n3. Choose “SV Launcher” and turn it on.\n\nIf SV Launcher is already chosen in the system and the Home button opens it, the service is not needed.</string>
